From 82f8c134ff6857c40903f3e80305fa8612d35ba3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Pardha Kesapragada <pkesapragada@habana.ai>
Date: Tue, 02 Feb 2021 15:06:13 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-20154] gaudi2: add support for image verification

This patch enables RSA3072 verification of images using
Uboot APIs and SHA384 checksum. In Gaudi2, there are only
two possible locations for Keys - eFUSE and ROM. Hence
the key hash checking is modified accordingly.

Change-Id: Id06ea1a32ac2e88e0b616209f416372ea076318a
Signed-off-by: Pardha Kesapragada <pkesapragada@habana.ai>
---

